==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|zerloufen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|ziloufan}}, {{m|goh|zihloufan}}. Equivalent to {{af|de|zer-|laufen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/t͡sɛɐ̯ˈlaʊ̯fən/}}
* {{rhymes|de|aʊ̯fən|s=3}}
* {{audio|de|De-zerlaufen.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|zerlaufen<zerläuft#zerlief,zerlaufen.sein>}}

# to [[lose]] [[form]] [[due]] to [[melting]], to [[melt away]]
#: {{syn|de|zergehen|zerschmelzen}}
#: {{uxi|de|Lassen Sie die Butter in der Pfanne '''zerlaufen'''.|Leave the butter in the pan to melt.}}
# to [[ruin]] (shoes) by using them, to [[wear out]]
#: {{uxi|de|Ich hab meine Turnschuhe bei der Tour '''zerlaufen'''.|I have worn out my gym shoes in the tour.}}

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj|zerlaufen<zerläuft#zerlief,zerlaufen.sein>}}

